      "writtenOn": "2022-11-17T17:17:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, the problem that causes the build failure is that the implementation of the stubs library is not available to the platform and so not exposed to Make.  Would it make sense to check that here instead of having an explicit property?",
      "revId": "d20376bab59df751576b16a992f310b5493f6593",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cb34f193_5f6f2c26",
        "filename": "apex/apex.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 2310,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-18T12:22:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have concerns about that:\n- Do we want to assume that \"not exposed to Make\" is always equivalent to \"not available to the platform\"?\n- Doesn\u0027t it just negate the missing dependency checker? Here I\u0027m providing a way to say explicitly that the dependency is not needed, but we still want to warn if it is omitted accidentally.\n- I can be fairly confident this change doesn\u0027t affect any other targets; I am less confident for the alternative.",
      "parentUuid": "60177aa2_416e8b34",
      "revId": "d20376bab59df751576b16a992f310b5493f6593",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1b1b8fdb_02b55baf",
        "filename": "cc/library.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 77,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-17T17:17:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"required\" is an implementation detail of how we install the implementation library, and not obvious to the end user how it is relevant here.  Would something like \"implementation_installable\" make sense?   Maybe its difficult to succinctly explain \"installable to the platform\" and \"installable to a microdroid vm\".",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 77,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 77,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "d20376bab59df751576b16a992f310b5493f6593",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
